{"ex-404-1":{"id":"ex-404-1","chapter":"404","number":1,"title":"電器以不同電壓操作 (I)","question":"<p>電熨斗的額定值是「220 V，1800 W」。</p><p>(a) 求電熨斗的電阻。</p><p>(b) 電熨斗在美國使用，美國的市電電壓為 120 V。求電熨斗消耗的功率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/41ad9afcac8b0106b5ff273f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:233.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 26.9 Ω</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 535 W</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":2,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,424.85898339843754,560.2833009033203,644.8158721923828],"text":"例 題 1 電器以不同電壓操作 (I)\r\n電熨斗的額定值是「220 V，1800 W」。\r\n(a) 求電熨斗的電阻。\r\n(b) 電熨斗在美國使用，美國的市電電壓為 120 V。求電熨斗消耗的\r\n功率。\r\n"},{"page":2,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,644.8158721923828,560.2833009033203,745.9559833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) R = V2\r\nP = 2202\r\n1800\r\n = 26.9 Ω\r\n(b) P = V2\r\nR = 1202\r\n26.9 = 535 W\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-404-2":{"id":"ex-404-2","chapter":"404","number":2,"title":"電器以不同電壓操作 (II)","question":"<p>城市 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的市電電壓是 220 V，城市 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的市電電壓是 110 V。比較在兩個城市用同一個電水壺煮沸同等分量的水所需的時間。假設水的初始温度相同。</p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V ^{2}}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span> )<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{ER}{V ^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ∝ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{V ^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>（ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> 恆定不變）</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{t_{A}}{t_{B}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V_{B}^{2}}{V_{A}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>110</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>220</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{110^{2}}{220^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>∴ 在城市 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所需的時間是城市 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的 4 倍。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,167.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 2 電器以不同電壓操作 (II)\r\n城市 A 的市電電壓是 220 V，城市 B 的市電電壓是 110 V。比較在兩\r\n個城市用同一個電水壺煮沸同等分量的水所需的時間。假設水的初始\r\n温度相同。\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,167.6500701904297,560.2833009033203,334.6869833984375],"text":"題解\r\nE = Pt = •\r\nV2\r\nR\r\n•\r\nt\r\n∴ t = ER\r\nV 2 ∝ 1\r\nV 2\r\n（E 和 R 恆定不變）\r\ntA\r\ntB\r\n = VB\r\n2\r\nVA\r\n2 = 1102\r\n2202 = 1\r\n4\r\n∴ 在城市 B 所需的時間是城市 A 的 4 倍。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-404-3":{"id":"ex-404-3","chapter":"404","number":3,"title":"電器以不同電壓操作 (III)","question":"<p>根據設計，發熱器可以 220 V 或 110 V 操作，功率同樣是 1500 W。</p><p>發熱器的電路如圖所示，兩個發熱元件的電阻為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。電壓為220 V 時，旋鈕 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 應連接到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端；電壓為 110 V 時，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span> 則連接到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/619d8d059c6d9bf3cdebf414.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:322.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 32.3 Ω</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 8.07 Ω</p>","tips":"<p>提示：為保持相同的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 可知，當 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 減小時，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 應減小。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,351.58098339843747,560.2833009033203,578.9106597900391],"text":"例 題 3 電器以不同電壓操作 (III)\r\n根據設計，發熱器可以 220 V 或 110 V 操作，功率同樣是 1500 W。\r\n發熱器的電路如圖所示，兩個發熱元件的電阻為 R1 和 R2。電壓為\r\n220 V 時，旋鈕 S 應連接到 X 端；電壓為 110 V 時，S 則連接到 Y\r\n端。求 R1 和 R2。\r\nX R1\r\nR2\r\nY\r\nS\r\n發熱元件\r\n接市電\r\n電源\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,578.9106597900391,560.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"題解\r\nR1 = V2\r\nP\r\n = 2202\r\n1500 = 32.3 Ω\r\nR2 = V2\r\nP\r\n = 1102\r\n1500\r\n = 8.07 Ω\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"tips","box":[40,347.58098339843747,179.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n根據 R = V2\r\nP ，如果要 P 相\r\n同，V 減 小 時，R 也應減\r\n小。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-404-4":{"id":"ex-404-4","chapter":"404","number":4,"title":"電暖爐消耗的能量","question":"<p>一個電暖爐的功率為 2 kW，開啟了 45 分鐘。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/231f6cdb3c60b159a5ff8867.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:234.1px\"></p><p>(a) 求消耗的電能，分別以 (i) J 及 (ii) kW h 表示。</p><p>(b) 如果每 1 kW h 電力的費用為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>?</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，應付多少電費？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (2000 W) × (45 × 60 s) = 5.4 × 10<sup>6</sup> J</p><p>(ii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (2 kW) × (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>45</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{45}{60}</annotation></semantics></math></span> h) = 1.5 kW h</p><p>(b) 電費 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1 \\times  1.5 = </annotation></semantics></math></span>1.65</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>計算電費時，能量應以 kW h 表示。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[183.4833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.4833009033202,296.9728240966797],"text":"例 題 4 電暖爐消耗的能量\r\n電暖爐消耗 2 kW 的功率，並開着了 45 分鐘。\r\n(a) 求消耗的電能，答案以 (i) J 和 (ii) kW h 為單位。\r\n(b) 如果每 kW h 的電費為 $1.1，開着電暖爐的電費是多少？\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[183.4833009033203,296.9728240966797,560.4833009033202,417.0099833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) E = Pt = (2000 W) × (45 × 60 s) = 5.4 × 106\r\n J\r\n (ii) E = Pt = (2 kW) ×\r\n•45\r\n60\r\n h•\r\n = 1.5 kW h\r\n(b) 電費 = $1.1 × 1.5 = $1.65\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.4833009033203,417.0099833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n計算電費時，能量要以\r\nkW h 為單位。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-404-5":{"id":"ex-404-5","chapter":"404","number":5,"title":"保險絲額定值","question":"<p>電飯煲的額定值是「220 V，1000 W」。</p><p>(a) 這電飯煲應配以 3 A、5 A 還是 15 A 的保險絲？</p><p>(b) 焗爐的額定值為「220 V，2000 W」。電飯煲可以與焗爐並聯連接到由 13 A 保險絲保護的插座嗎？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VI</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p>額定電流 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P}{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>220</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1000}{220}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 4.55 A ∴ 應使用 5 A 保險絲。</p><p>(b) 焗爐的額定電流 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P}{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2000</mn><mn>220</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2000}{220}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 9.09 A</p><p>兩部電器的總電流 = 4.55 + 9.09 = 13.6 A &gt; 13 A ∴ 電飯煲不應該與焗爐並聯連接到插座。否則，插座的保險絲會熔斷。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,195.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 5 保險絲額定值\r\n電飯煲的額定值是「220 V，1000 W」。\r\n(a) 這電飯煲應配以 3 A、5 A 還是 15 A 的保險絲？\r\n(b) 焗爐的額定值為「220 V，2000 W」。電飯煲可以與焗爐並聯連接\r\n到由 13 A 保險絲保護的插座嗎？\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,195.6500701904297,565.2833009033203,512.6869833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 根據 P = VI，\r\n額定電流 = P\r\nV\r\n = 1000\r\n220\r\n= 4.55 A\r\n∴ 應使用 5 A 保險絲。\r\n(b) 焗爐的額定電流 = P\r\nV\r\n = 2000\r\n220\r\n= 9.09 A\r\n兩部電器的總電流 = 4.55 + 9.09 = 13.6 A > 13 A\r\n∴ 電飯煲不應該與焗爐並聯連接到插座。否則，插座的保險絲會\r\n熔斷。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-404-6":{"id":"ex-404-6","chapter":"404","number":6,"title":"選擇電線","question":"<p>下圖是一幅家居電線佈置簡圖，當中的照明電路包含三盞相同的電燈，三盞電燈以並聯連接。</p><p>如要儘量降低佈置電線的費用，在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 三處，應使用額定值為2 A、6 A、17 A、63 A，還是 100 A 的電線？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/7040663547b35b27e892077d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:518.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>可能流過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的最大電流是 15 A。</p><p>∴ 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點應使用 17 A 的電線。</p><p>可能流過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的最大電流 = 30 + 5 + 15 + 30 = 80 A ∴ 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點應使用 100 A 的電線。</p><p>可能流過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的最大電流 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.67 A</p><p>∴ 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點應使用 2 A 的電線。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>當 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> &gt; 15 A 時，斷路器便會跳掣。火線與中性線中的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 相同。</p><p>提示</p><p>電線必須能承受最大電流，否則會在斷路器跳掣前燒毀。為降低成本，應使用能承受該電流的最幼電線（額定電流最低）。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":16,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,267.53998339843747,560.2833009033203,570.0819549560547],"text":"例 題 6 選擇電線\r\n下圖是一幅家居電線佈置簡圖，當中的照明電路包含三盞相同的電\r\n燈，三盞電燈以並聯連接。\r\n市電\r\n電纜\r\n總開關\r\nY E\r\nX\r\n千瓦時計\r\n電力公司主保險絲\r\n斷路器\r\n照明電路\r\n環形 熱水器\r\n幹線\r\n冷氣機\r\n30 A 5 A 15 A 30 A\r\nN\r\nL\r\nZ\r\n如要儘量降低佈置電線的費用，在 X、Y 和 Z 三處，應使用額定值為\r\n2 A、6 A、17 A、63 A，還是 100 A 的電線？\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,570.0819549560547,560.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題解\r\n可能流過 X 點的最大電流是 15 A。\r\n∴ 在 X 點應使用 17 A 的電線。\r\n可能流過 Y 點的最大電流 = 30 + 5 + 15 + 30 = 80 A\r\n∴ 在 Y 點應使用 100 A 的電線。\r\n可能流過 Z 點的最大電流 = 5\r\n3\r\n = 1.67 A\r\n∴ 在 Z 點應使用 2 A 的電線。\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"tips","box":[40,263.53998339843747,179.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n如果 I > 15 A，斷 路 器 就\r\n會切斷電路。\r\n在活線和中線中的 I 是相同\r\n的。\r\n提提你\r\n電線必須能夠承載最大電\r\n流，否則電線會在斷路器切\r\n斷電路之前燒毁。\r\n要儘量降低費用，應使用能\r\n承載電流的最幼（額定值最\r\n低）電線。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-404-7":{"id":"ex-404-7","chapter":"404","number":7,"title":"方均根值與峯值","question":"<p>焗爐的額定值是「220 V，1500 W」，連接到電壓方均根值為 220 V，頻率為 50 Hz 的市電。</p><p>(a) 求焗爐的電阻 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 求流過焗爐的最大瞬時電流（即峯值電流）<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 如果把焗爐連接至另一個城市的電源，電壓為 120 V，頻率為60 Hz，焗爐消耗的最大瞬時功率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是多少？</p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> <sup>2</sup></p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{rm}{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <sup>s</sup> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>220</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1500</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{220^{2}}{1500}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 32.2667 Ω ≈ 32.3 Ω</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{rms}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P}{V_{rms}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1500</mn><mn>220</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1500}{220}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.82 A</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{rms}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 6.82 = 9.64 A</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{rms}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 120 = 169.7 V</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V_{p}^{2}}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>169.7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>32.2667</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{169.7^{2}}{32.2667}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 893 W</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_404_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"466bf8bdc7ee440bf06c38dda3a1820f74afc3a04c468150eb42160b8e668d9d","segments":[{"page":28,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,402.8179833984375,560.2833009033203,565.1334686279297],"text":"例 題 7 方均根值與峯值\r\n焗爐的額定值是「220 V，1500 W」，連接到電壓方均根值為220 V，\r\n頻率為 50 Hz 的市電。\r\n(a) 求焗爐的電阻 R。\r\n(b) 求流過焗爐的最大瞬時電流（即峯值電流）Ip。\r\n(c) 如果把焗爐連接至另一個城市的電源，電壓為 120 V，頻率為\r\n60 Hz，焗爐消耗的最大瞬時功率 Pp 是多少？\r\n"},{"page":28,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,565.1334686279297,560.2833009033203,746.2739833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) R = Vrms\r\n2\r\nP = 2202\r\n1500 = 32.2667 Ω ≈ 32.3 Ω\r\n(b) Irms = P\r\nVrms\r\n = 1500\r\n220 = 6.82 A\r\nIp = •  \r\n2 Irms = •  \r\n2 × 6.82 = 9.64 A\r\n(c) Vp = •  \r\n2 Vrms = •  \r\n2 × 120 = 169.7 V \r\nPp = Vp\r\n2\r\nR = 169.72\r\n32.2667 = 893 W\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}